    <h1>Three generations, <em>one promise.</em></h1>
    <p class="clearwater-lead">Clearwater was started by Sam Kovac in 1997 with one truck and one phone line. Today it's Sam (semi-retired), his son Mike, his daughter-in-law Tess who runs the office, and a team of six licensed plumbers.</p>
